# MI Agent front-end configuration.
#
# Leave unset to run in demo mode (MockAgentClient). Set the API URL to bind the
# UI to the live MI Agent API (mi_agent_api / FastAPI).
#
# VITE_AGENT_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# VITE_AGENT_MODE=mock   # force mock even when an API URL is set
#
# Codespaces / forwarded ports (no CORS): the dev server proxies /mi + /health to
# the API, so run the UI with a relative base URL to stay same-origin:
#   VITE_AGENT_API_URL=/ npm run dev
# (optional) point the proxy at a non-default API host:
#   VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000

# --- Entra bearer authentication (Phase 3), OFF by default -------------------
#
# With VITE_MI_BEARER_AUTH unset or false the app behaves exactly as it does
# today: no MSAL, no token, no Authorization header, and the Static Web Apps
# Easy Auth session remains the credential.
#
# These are PUBLIC identifiers — a SPA bundle contains all of them by design.
# This is a public client using Authorization Code + PKCE. There is NO client
# secret, and `npm run build` fails if anything secret-shaped reaches dist/.
#
# VITE_MI_BEARER_AUTH=true
# VITE_AAD_CLIENT_ID=<trakt-react-dashboard application (client) id>
# VITE_MI_API_SCOPE=api://f7473442-de15-49f4-b6da-a9634bcbea8f/MI.Access
# (optional) defaults to https://login.microsoftonline.com/organizations:
# VITE_AAD_AUTHORITY=https://login.microsoftonline.com/organizations
